cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software or data, please cite the paper.
title: "GazeSpeakZero: a webcam-only gaze communication aid, and its measurement"
abstract: >-
  Code, session logs and figures for "Seeing is not selecting: measuring a
  webcam-only gaze communication aid". The work measures how far per-frame
  benchmark accuracy overstates live per-selection accuracy for a gaze-operated
  communication aid that needs no hardware beyond an ordinary webcam.
